@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Partial Design — Register Arrival and Record Consultation (design only)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
class ClinicCLI <<boundary>>
class ArrivalController <<controller>> {
  +registerArrival(appointmentID)
}
class ConsultationController <<controller>> {
  +recordConsultation(appointmentID, observations, diagnoses, recommendations, followUp)
  -validateAtLeastOneNonBlankClinicalField()
}
class AccessPolicy {
  +requireRole(session, role)
  +requireAssignedProfessionalAndCareScope(session, appointment)
}
class AppointmentBook {
  +get(appointmentID) : Appointment
}
class Appointment {
  appointmentID : String
  patientID : String
  location : ClinicLocation
  dateTime : LocalDateTime
  status
  arrivalTime [0..1]
  +requireConfirmed()
  +requireDate(clinicDate)
  +requireNotArrived()
  +requireConfirmedAndArrivedWithoutConsultation()
  +stageArrival(arrivalTime, staffID)
  +stageComplete(consultation)
}
class ClinicLocation {
  locationID : String
  timeZone : ZoneId
}
class ClinicClock {
  +todayAt(location)
  +nowAt(location)
}
class ClinicalRecordCatalog {
  +getForPatient(patientID : String) : ClinicalRecord
}
class ClinicalRecord {
  recordID : String
  patientID : String
  +stageAdd(consultation : Consultation)
}
class Consultation {
  consultationID
  observations
  diagnoses
  treatmentRecommendations
  followUpRequirements
  +create(uniqueID, clinicalFields, appointmentID)
}
class UnitOfWork {
  +begin()
  +commit()
}
class AuditLog {
  +stageRecord(actorID, patientID, action, outcome)
  +recordDeniedAttempt(actorID, patientID, failureCode)
}
class AuditRecord {
  auditID
  occurredAt
  action
  outcome
}
ClinicCLI --> ArrivalController
ClinicCLI --> ConsultationController
ArrivalController --> AppointmentBook
ArrivalController --> AccessPolicy
ArrivalController --> ClinicClock
ArrivalController --> UnitOfWork
ArrivalController --> AuditLog
ConsultationController --> AppointmentBook
ConsultationController --> AccessPolicy
ConsultationController --> ClinicalRecordCatalog
ConsultationController --> ClinicalRecord
ClinicalRecordCatalog o-- "0..*" ClinicalRecord
Appointment --> "1" ClinicLocation : takes place at
ConsultationController --> Consultation : creates
ConsultationController --> UnitOfWork
ConsultationController --> AuditLog
AppointmentBook o-- "0..*" Appointment
Appointment "1" -- "0..1" Consultation : results in
ClinicalRecord "1" -- "0..*" Consultation : contains
AuditLog o-- "0..*" AuditRecord
note bottom of UnitOfWork
Staged domain changes and success audit are committed together.
Failure discards all staged changes (original contracts CR1/CR2).
This describes in-memory atomicity, not a required database implementation.
end note
note bottom of Appointment
These are the target design classes used by interactions 2 and 3.
They extend the scheduling design; they are not implemented by the PoC.
Arrival stays confirmed; recording consultation changes status to completed.
Existing Appointment, ClinicalRecord, Consultation and AuditRecord concepts are retained.
end note
@enduml
